# The SRD-coverage specs and everything generated from them are compared byte
# for byte by `npm run validate:srd-monsters`, so their line endings cannot
# depend on the checkout. Pinning them to LF keeps the check honest on Windows.
# See issue #49 for the same problem in the older tracked generated files.
content/srd-monsters/** text eol=lf
converted/srd-monsters/** text eol=lf
